         <div type="bio">
            <p>American publisher, co-founder of the firm Boni and Liveright, which included two of JJ’s poems in the <hi rend="italic">Anthology of Irish Verse</hi> (1922). Liveright negotiated with JJ to take over publication of <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name> and to collaborate in publication of <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Ulysses</name>, but neither scheme produced results. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
         </div>
